# Ergo holds 433 until CAP END. The alternate is tried, then the nick padded
# with _ up to 9 characters, then registration gives up.
= nick taken
= alternates taken_
= caps multi-prefix
> CAP LS 302
> NICK taken
> USER textual 0 * Textual
< :ergo.test CAP * LS :multi-prefix
> CAP REQ multi-prefix
< :ergo.test CAP * ACK multi-prefix
> CAP END
< :ergo.test 433 * taken :Nickname is already in use
> NICK taken_
? notice The nick taken is already in use; trying taken_
< :ergo.test 433 * taken_ :Nickname is already in use
> NICK taken__
? notice The nick taken_ is already in use; trying taken__
< :ergo.test 433 * taken__ :Nickname is already in use
> NICK taken___
? notice The nick taken__ is already in use; trying taken___
< :ergo.test 437 * taken___ :Nick/channel is temporarily unavailable
> NICK taken____
? notice The nick taken___ is temporarily unavailable; trying taken____
< :ergo.test 433 * taken____ :Nickname is already in use
> hangup #1
? notice Disconnected: every nick was refused (taken, taken_, taken__, taken___, taken____); reconnecting in 5 s
? failed no-usable-nick
